{"slug":"/components/announcement-bar","title":"Announcement Bar — Animated React Component — Planes","desc":"An announcement strip on a live dither surface. It rests dim and still; hover and the dither wakes, clearing from the side the cursor came in.","html":"<main class=\"min-w-0 py-24\"><section><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1.5 px-4 pb-2 sm:px-8 lg:px-16\"><h1 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-3xl\">Announcement Bar</h1><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-foreground/8 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock size-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg> Pro</span></div><div class=\"py-10 sm:py-14\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center bg-background min-h-[60vh] py-12 sm:py-16\"><div class=\"flex w-full justify-center px-4 py-16\"><div class=\"w-full max-w-5xl overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-950\"><div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Announcement\" class=\"relative isolate w-full overflow-hidden bg-zinc-950 text-white\" style=\"opacity:1;height:auto;transform:none\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, #000000, #1d4ed8 60%, #93c5fd)\"><canvas class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full\"></canvas><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/45\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/45\" style=\"clip-path:inset(0 100% 0 0)\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/45\" style=\"clip-path:inset(0 0 0 0%)\"></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto flex min-h-10 w-full max-w-300 items-center gap-