linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg></button></div></div><header class=\"flex h-14 items-center justify-between px-4 sm:px-6\"><span class=\"text-[14px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">Acme</span></header><div class=\"px-4 pt-10 pb-16 sm:px-6\"><p class=\"max-w-[44ch] text-[15px] leading-7 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">Hover the bar to wake the dither from the side you came in. Dismiss it and the strip folds away.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl space-y-16 px-4 py-16 sm:px-8 lg:px-16\"><section id=\"installation\" class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"mb-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\">Installation</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-foreground/8 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock size-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg> Pro</span><span class=\"text-[12px] text-muted-foreground\">Requires a Planes Pro license.</span></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-4 shadow-xs\"><div class=\"absolute right-3 top-3 z-10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg bg-secondary p-1\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy\" class=\"relative inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay text-